      "excerpt": "2025年年报披露，南亚新材主营覆铜板及粘结片等复合材料的设计、研发、生产和销售；覆铜板产品包括普通FR-4、无铅兼容型FR-4和无卤无铅兼容型FR-4等系列。",
      "excerpt_en": "The 2025 annual report identifies Nanya's design, development, manufacture, and sale of copper-clad laminates, including standard, lead-free-compatible, and halogen-free FR-4 series.",
