      "excerpt": "2025年年报披露，华正新材主营覆铜板等产品的设计、研发、生产和销售，并以覆铜板基础材料为基石，逐步实现相关产品的稳定生产和交付。",
      "excerpt_en": "The 2025 annual report identifies Wazam's design, development, manufacture, and sale of copper-clad laminates and describes base laminate materials as an established production and delivery foundation.",
